{
  "name": "dsh-context-pilot",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "DSH 上下文智能压缩 + 智能思考：每轮注入用量、模型自主决定压缩并自动续跑；可选让模型按任务难度自主调整思考强度档位",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Shuffle-1992",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Shuffle-1992/dsh-context-pilot#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Shuffle-1992/dsh-context-pilot.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Shuffle-1992/dsh-context-pilot/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis-plugin",
    "context-compression",
    "context-management",
    "reasoning-effort",
    "llm-agent"
  ],
  "files": [
    "plugin",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./plugin/entry.mjs",
    "./client": "./plugin/client.js",
    "./typert": "./plugin/wire.host.mjs",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./plugin/cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-plugins",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ]
    }
  },
  "meta": {
    "title": "上下文智能压缩",
    "description": "每轮读取上下文用量（上限/已用/占比）注入 prompt，占用达智能压缩线时模型可自行决定压缩并自动续跑；占用达强制压缩线时插件在 pre-step 无条件发起压缩（执行路径相同：先自算保留范围，官方 overflow 兜底/收口）。智能思考（可选）：开启后向 Agent 暴露当前模型的思考强度档位，并允许其自主换档——下一步生效、任务不中断。"
  },
  "icon": "./plugin/icon.svg",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/run.mjs",
    "test:contract": "node test/contract.mjs",
    "test:static": "node test/static.mjs",
    "test:report": "node test/report.mjs",
    "dump": "node docs/reference/tools/dump-report.cjs",
    "asar": "node docs/reference/tools/asar-query.cjs"
  }
}
